{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"86372cbd4b76439edb9041576abb7dfc01d63bf176d0f30946645635dc750c60","digest":{"component_or_area":"bridge suggest-mapping command","key_entities":["rebar bridge suggest-mapping","mapping_probe.py","mapping_config.py","_emit_nested_toml","_emit_config_toml","jira.JIRA","issue_types","statuses","link_types","priority_map","hierarchy","create_defaults","createmeta_issuetypes","search_issues","transitions","pyproject.toml","_bridge_suggest_mapping"],"problem_keywords":["jira probe","mapping config","auto-generation","vocabulary discovery","toml serialization","live issue tracking"],"propositions":["A new read-only CLI verb `rebar bridge suggest-mapping` probes a live Jira project and emits a suggested `[tool.rebar.mapping]` TOML block seeded with the project's vocabulary and identity-mapped axis values, without writing to Jira or files by default.","The mapping probe discovers axis vocabulary (issue_types, statuses, link_types, priorities) via documented high-level pycontribs JIRA client methods; hierarchy is dropped if absent, transitions are best-effort partial hints based on sample issues.","Writing with `--write` flag performs deep-merge into `rebar.toml` under `[mapping.projects.<KEY>]`, preserving existing hand-edited keys and flat `[jira]`/`[tracker]` siblings, using a new orchestrator that splits flat and nested TOML emission.","New helpers `_emit_nested_toml` and `_emit_config_toml` in `_config_writer.py` handle recursive nested table serialization to dotted headers, leaving `_emit_toml` unchanged and its fail-closed contract pinned by existing tests.","The probe uses only canned offline data in unit tests via a fake port; live credentials are never gated in CI, and comment round-tripping is out of scope.","Default `[tool.rebar.mapping]` includes stubs only for createmeta-required fields not in the outbound create baseline (summary, description, issuetype, priority, assignee, status, parent)."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787475890553178001,"uuid":"f7c91c85-ba25-4b3b-82ff-ea7a6ef535d5"}